      "content": "hey, im working on a report for a client who wants to know how to position their luxury lifestyle brand. i need u to help me categorize some of these current slang terms and musical vibes so we know if they are \"high-end/sophisticated\" or more \"mass-market/street\" level. \n\nhere is the first batch:\n1. \"rizz\"\n2. \"drill music\"\n3. \"old money aesthetic\"\n4. \"no cap\"\n\ncan u give me a breakdown of each? tell me the vibe/sophistication level and what kind of demographic would be using them? thanks.",
