      "role": "user",
      "content": "interesting. can u expand on that drill music part? u said it's \"urban contemporary culture\" and \"street level\"—is that because of the lyrical content or just the general demographic? i'm trying to figure out if it's something a luxury brand could ever \"reclaim\" to look edgy/cool, or if it's just too tied to a specific low-income/neighborhood vibe to work for a high-end client.",
